# v8.3: every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. Without this, a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true, which is the default on GitHub's windows runners) turns the demo JSON files into
# CRLF, and taz_persist_tests' byte-exact round trip (t11) fails there for a reason that has nothing to
# do with the code. The chain file format is plain ASCII JSON with LF line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
explorer/** linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-detectable=false
*.js linguist-detectable=false
*.json linguist-generated
